    "Pharos Settings — %@" : {

    },
    "Pharos adds a card that copies the table, with its rows, into this DuckDB database's main schema." : {

    },
    "Pharos adds a card that creates the table in “%@”, and a card that shows its first rows. Edit the first card to change how the file is read." : {

    },
    "Pharos also forgets the database files that no Session or tab uses. Their query history and workspaces stay, but they open without a connection. The files stay where they are." : {

    },
    "Pharos also forgets this file. Its query history and Results History workspaces stay, but they open without a connection. The file stays where it is." : {

    },
    "Pharos attaches the database read-only as %@ in a new in-memory database. DuckDB reads the file from this address while you run queries.\n\n%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Pharos attaches the database read-only as %1$@ in a new in-memory database. DuckDB reads the file from this address while you run queries.\n\n%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
